<a name="details" id="details"></a><h2 id="header-details" class="groupheader">Detailed Description</h2>
<div class="textblock"><p>Connection state corresponding to when a client is attempting to connect to a server. Starts the client when entering. If successful, transitions to the ClientConnected state. If not, transitions to the Offline state. </p>
</div><a name="doc-func-members" id="doc-func-members"></a><h2 id="header-doc-func-members" class="groupheader">Member Function Documentation</h2>
